      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "entailed",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC10759803::rubric_card::000::1894dec07a"
      ],
      "same_system": "yes"
    },
    {
      "text": "The Cr-induced Laves phase occupies approximately 3–4 vol% of the alloy.",
      "field": "intervention",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "The Cr-induced Laves phase is fine, continuous, reticulated, and uniformly distributed in the BCC matrix.",
      "field": "structural_mediator",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "Chromium addition locally alters lattice distortion.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "The reticulated Laves phase acts as a crack arrestor and blunts crack propagation.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "The Laves phase facilitates dislocation motion and promotes uniform plastic flow.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "The BCC matrix allows the Cr-containing alloy to retain high strength.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC10759803::rubric_card::000::1894dec07a"
      ],
      "same_system": "yes"
    },
    {
      "text": "The Cr-containing alloy will show an approximately 15–20% increase in fracture strain or elongation over the untreated alloy.",
      "field": "predicted_outcome",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "The Cr-containing alloy will deform more uniformly under impact loading.",
      "field": "predicted_outcome",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "The Cr-containing alloy will maintain strength comparable to or greater than that of the untreated alloy.",
      "field": "predicted_outcome",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC10759803::rubric_card::000::1894dec07a"
      ],
      "same_system": "yes"
    },
    {
      "text": "The Cr-containing alloy will preserve the untreated alloy's capacity for impact-induced energy release.",
      "field": "predicted_outcome",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
